    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: Active Product2 records whose blng__TaxRule__c reference is inactive.
Why it matters: Tax calculation falls back to defaults or fails entirely — you either under-charge tax (audit exposure) or block invoice generation. Customers see wrong tax lines on first invoice.
Suppress a finding: during a planned rule cutover.
Disable the detector: only if you don&apos;t use Salesforce Billing tax. Most should leave this on.</value></values>
